<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TH" style="id">- BUU</book>
  <para style="h">2TH - BUU</para>
  <para style="toc1">2TH - BUU</para>
  <para style="toc2">2TH - BUU</para>
  <para style="toc3">2TH - BUU</para>
  <para style="mt1">2TH - BUU</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 1:1" />Imbe nyi zhu ri ame Bulus, ri Sila, nga Timoti, hi ri wa hu Izhi ri Tasalonika, riwa a he wa A ti mbu Izhi nga Bachi Yeso Kristo:<verse eid="2TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 1:2" />Ki ibreno Ti mbu Izhi nga Bachi Yeso Kristo no yi dindi ti nga sisron.<verse eid="2TH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ide ri Ngɨri Ngha Bre Izhi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 1:3" />Imiri vayi mbu miriron nga mirimba, a bi ki ngɨri ri Izhi bla vi ritu mbi, ritu yosron mbi ri gbron bran nga nyɨme riwa bi he ri wu ri ngambi ari he rigra. <verse eid="2TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 1:4" />Ikya riwa a no ta kita kyumbu ki kpo ngambu ritu mbi ri tra Izhi. Ki kpo ngambu ritu bibi riwa bi si vu sron nga bi ri yosron ri yaa riwa bi si to.<verse eid="2TH 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 1:5" />Rinyi tsro ri wa bla yi sro rimi wawa wa gra ri ko Izhi riwa bi so ya ritu wan. <verse eid="2TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 1:6" />Izhi ri ti kya riwa a tsra: A ri ngɨzhi ya ye ri wawa wa no yi so ya, <verse eid="2TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 1:7" />nga ari no yi son vri biyi wawa bi so ya nga kita ngawen. Ari ti kyanyi inde Bachi Yeso a zhu ri shu ri wa ndu wan wa rigra, ri nzan wulu. <verse eid="2TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 1:8" />A ri no wawa wa kamba ri Izhi nga wawa wana hu tre dindi riwa Bachi Yeso ran. <verse eid="2TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 1:9" />Wa so ya riwa ri kuu riwa a ran kre ran, wa ŋren wa zho ri kusi Bachi nga ri gbengbren nkpen wan. <verse eid="2TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 1:10" />Ka a ye ri vi mba riwa ari kpa nkpen nga gbre wan ri wawa wa kpa nyɨme ri wu, biyi ngawen bi he ri wa, ritu wu kpanyɨme ri tre riwa ki la yi.<verse eid="2TH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 1:11" />Ritu wan nye kii sasi bre Izhi ri yi. Ki miyen Izhi no no yi fe riwa a yo yi no yi he. No ko ngye ri dindi riwa bi wa bi ri fe wu nga ran kre ndu mbi ri yo sron. <verse eid="2TH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 1:12" />Ri nganyi, ki ibreno nde Bachi Yeso mbu no fe gbre ri yi, nga biyi ri wu, ri dindi ti riwa Izhi mbu nga riwa Bachi Yeso Kristo.<verse eid="2TH 1:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TH 2" />
  <para style="s">Nji ri Meme Sron</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 2:1" />Ki wa ki ri la yi ritu bru ye riwa Bachi Yeso Kristo mbu nga kabru mbu ri wu, ki ibreyi miri vayi, <verse eid="2TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 2:2" />ran no sisiri vu yi gbagbla ran ko no sron mbi no wulunde ritu la tre riwa Yuu, ko itre ko mbe riwa wa ngaan iri a zhuu ritu ri tre ri ivi ye Bachi nye ye. <verse eid="2TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 2:3" />Ran nyɨme no njo no gyuru yi ko rimi nkon ritu ivi nyi ran ye ran tse ichu wanyu nye ye nji riwa ari wuu nji-a ko no Izhi no ye. <verse eid="2TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 2:4" />Ari gbre ngawan han kongye riwa a bi nga han gbre Izhi. Ari hi ran kuson ri tra bre wa Izhi ri wawu nye he Izhi. <verse eid="2TH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 2:5" />Bi ran taka kya riwa me ran la yi ka ki he iwayi ran? <verse eid="2TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 2:6" />Ko mbaron zizan bi to kya riwa ari rau ri wa a ran no vi ye wan no ye ran. <verse eid="2TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 2:7" />Ko zizan, mgbimgbi nyi riwa wa ran to tu wan ran wa ti-u-e tsede inde wa ban wu zho ri. <verse eid="2TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 2:8" />Imba nye ichu mgbimgbi ri ye Bachi Yeso ri fu wuu ri viri ri nyu wan ran wuu zho chachu riwa ari bru ye. <verse eid="2TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 2:9" />Inji riwa ari ti mgbimgbi a ri ye rimi gbengbren memenji nye, ran ran ti kyawa wa de sisiri ri bibi wan, ri bibi ndu ri ka ri che kankan, <verse eid="2TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 2:10" />Ngha ari gyuru wawa wa he rimi hi rinkon kuu, meme gyuru, ritu wa wa kamba ri nyime kpunji tre bibi riwa wa fe kpa chuwo. <verse eid="2TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 2:11" />Ritu nganyi, Izhi ri ngɨzhi nchon wulusu ri ye ri wa bibi riwa wa kpa tre riwa a he che. <verse eid="2TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 2:12" />Ritu riwa waka don vu nji wawa wa kamba ri kpa tre ri kpunji, nga wawa wa to ro ti meme ti.<verse eid="2TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kri Mgbemgben</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 2:13" />Biyi miri vayi wawa bi kpa nyime ri Bachi a he riwa ki ran ngɨri ri Izhi ritu mba, ritu Izhi chu yi, no yi gbuchi fe kpa chuwo ritu Tsitsri riwa Yuu nga kpa nyime ri kpunji. <verse eid="2TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 2:14" />Ritu rinyi nye Izhi a yo yi ritu tre Izhi mba riwa ki tre bi ri ka don fe gbresan Bachi mbu Yeso. <verse eid="2TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 2:15" />Ritu nganyi miri vayi kri mgbemgbe, bi ri ngɨzhi kya riwa ki tsro yi kpekpe ko riwa ki tre ri nyu, ko riwa ki ngaan ri mbe. <verse eid="2TH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 2:16" />Ki bre Bachi mbu Yeso rituwan, nga Izhi A ti mbu, riwa a nyime ta ran bru no ta sisron riwa a ran kre ran ri dindi yosron itu dindi ti wan, <verse eid="2TH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 2:17" />a no yi sisron ran bru no yi tre ri no yi senkpa riwa bi ti dindi ndu bla nga tre.<verse eid="2TH 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TH 3" />
  <para style="s">Bre Izhi ri Ta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 3:1" />Ri kre tre, miri vayi bre Izhi rita itre Bachi a ri shan bla a fe gbre, bibi riwa wa a fe ri yi. <verse eid="2TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 3:2" />Wa kpa ta chuwo ri wo nji wa meme ti riwa wa ran kpa nyime ran. <verse eid="2TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 3:3" />Ama Bachi he nji ri lo tre zi, a ri kpa yi chuwo ri kya meme. <verse eid="2TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 3:4" />Ki kpa nyime ri yi ritu Bachi, iri bi hu tre doka riwa ki la yi bi ran hu ran hi. <verse eid="2TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 3:5" />Bachi a shu sron mba kabru ritu nyɨme Izhi nga vu sron riwa Yeso.<verse eid="2TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ifen Ton Ritu Sankon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 3:6" />To, imiri vayi ki no yi tre rimi nde Bachi mbu Yeso Kristo, zhu ri nkon ko bibi vayi ritan riwa a time riwa a ran hu kyawa wawa bi wo ri ta ran. <verse eid="2TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 3:7" />Biyi kyumbi bi to a bi no yi ti kya riwa bi to rita bi ri ti, don riwa ki he iwayi ki ran tsro yi sankon ran. <verse eid="2TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 3:8" />Ki ran ri bi ri njo kukulu ran ara riwa ki soya ki tindu ri ji ri chu, ritu riwa ki ran no iri mbi ya ran. <verse eid="2TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 3:9" />A ran he ritu riwa ki ran he ri ya mba ritu mbi ran onhon a he ritu riwa ki he kya ri ta ka nye riyi nga bi ri vu kya riwa bi to rita. <verse eid="2TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 3:10" />Ai, sisenmu, riwa ki he iwayi, ki layi tre doka nyi iri nji riwa a kawan ri ti ndu no wa ran no ri ran.<verse eid="2TH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 3:11" />Ritu ki wo ri wari mbi wa he wa sankon, wa ran ri tindu kyari ran, ari gyuru nji nye. <verse eid="2TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 3:12" />Bibi nji wanyi nye ki no wa doka ki ri ri no wa tre ritu Bachi Yeso, no wa ran milan ran ti ndu, wari ran ri ritu mba. <verse eid="2TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 3:13" />Ama biyi miri vayi ran kumbra ri ndu dindi ran. <verse eid="2TH 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 3:14" />Inde njo kawan ri tre ri wa ki ngaan ri mbe nyi, bi ka milan ya-u ran ka ngambi kabru ri wu ran don no shan noti-u. <verse eid="2TH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 3:15" />Ama ran kau ti kpanfu mbi ran tsede bi ka la-u tre ritu a he vayi mbi.<verse eid="2TH 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Itre Bulus ri Kremkpen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 3:16" />Ki ibreno Bachi rituwan riwa ari de son ri si sron, ari no yi si sron bla vi bla nkon. No Bachi no he riyi wawu.<verse eid="2TH 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 3:17" />Ame Bulus nye me ngaan chi nyi ri wo won wawu nye he riwa ari tsro yi ri ingan won nye mba.<verse eid="2TH 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TH 3:18" />Me ibreno dindi ti Bachi Yeso Kristo no he ri yi wawu.<verse eid="2TH 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 3" />
</usx>